### ==========================================
### 1. LOGIN & GET TOKEN
### ==========================================

### Login Sebagai Admin (Untuk dapat Token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Login Sebagai Kasir (Untuk dapat Token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "kasir",
    "password": "kasir123"
}


### ==========================================
### 2. USERS CRUD (PROTECTED ROUTES)
### ==========================================
### Ganti tulisan MASUKKAN_TOKEN_DISINI dengan token yang didapat dari request Login di atas!

@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImFkbWluIiwic3ViIjoiMTcwZmJmMGMtZWE5Ni00NTAyLWEzNGMtOTZmNDFlNzY4ZWViIiwicm9sZSI6IkFETUlOIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg5MTUxMDEyLCJleHAiOjE3ODkyMzc0MTJ9.WJC247WZZGB08pxvelGb8RCFoTQXRILcWz1_YqXG29o

### GET All Users (Bisa diakses ADMIN dan KASIR)
GET http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Create User Baru (HANYA BISA DIAKSES ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "User Baru",
    "username": "userbaru",
    "password": "userbaru123",
    "role": "KASIR"
}

###
GET http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET Single User by ID (Bisa diakses ADMIN dan KASIR)
### Ganti ID-nya dengan ID hasil create/get di atas!
GET http://localhost:3000/users/e9dd3246-938c-48d3-9620-ca8061324b5c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH Update User (HANYA BISA DIAKSES ADMIN)
### Ganti ID-nya dengan ID yang ingin di-edit
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/e9dd3246-938c-48d3-9620-ca8061324b5c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "User_Update",
    "username": "user_updated",
    "role": "KASIR",
    "password": "userbaru123"
}

### DELETE User (HANYA BISA DIAKSES ADMIN)
### Ganti ID-nya dengan ID yang ingin dihapus
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/e9dd3246-938c-48d3-9620-ca8061324b5c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### 3. PRODUCTS CRUD (PROTECTED ROUTES)
### ==========================================

### GET All Products (Bisa diakses ADMIN dan KASIR)
GET http://localhost:3000/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST Create Product Baru (HANYA BISA DIAKSES ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Kopi Susu",
    "price": 18000,
    "stock": 50
}

### GET Single Product by ID (Bisa diakses ADMIN dan KASIR)
### Ganti ID-nya dengan ID hasil create/get di atas!
GET http://localhost:3000/products/6ae94ed8-674f-4707-9f79-891cba43ca1d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH Update Product (HANYA BISA DIAKSES ADMIN)
### Ganti ID-nya dengan ID yang ingin di-edit
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/6ae94ed8-674f-4707-9f79-891cba43ca1d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Kopi Susu Aren",
    "price": 20000,
    "stock": 45
}

### DELETE Product (HANYA BISA DIAKSES ADMIN)
### Ganti ID-nya dengan ID yang ingin dihapus
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/6ae94ed8-674f-4707-9f79-891cba43ca1d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### 4. TRANSACTIONS (PROTECTED ROUTES)
### ==========================================

### Note:
### 1. Buat POST /transactions, pake Token KASIR (Role Kasir Only).
### 2. Ganti token_kasir dengan token JWT kasir hasil login.
### 3. Ganti productId dengan ID produk asli yang ada di DB lu.

@token_kasir = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6Imthc2lyIiwic3ViIjoiYjRhMzIxYmItNmIwOS00NDg4LWI2NzEtZWVlYWY1MjhiNjE0Iiwicm9sZSI6IktBU0lSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg5MTUwOTQwLCJleHAiOjE3ODkyMzczNDB9.9_EI7ngGTTFBC_d23efR6DFYr8WsKVk4U1zqvBWDbGg

### POST Checkout Transaksi Baru (HANYA BISA DIAKSES KASIR)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token_kasir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        {
            "productId": "d6876ab4-aa78-449d-946a-9f428b452284",
            "quantity": 2
        }
    ]
}

### GET All Transactions / Riwayat (Bisa diakses ADMIN & KASIR)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}